{
  "description": "std-stat-band — a band of headline figures from a config list: each item a big value (a number or short text such as '99.9%', '3x' or 'Open source') over a short label, centered in a row that wraps on small screens, under an optional heading. Display only — for figures computed from data use std-stats. Pick for 'by the numbers' strips on landing, about and product pages.",
